      "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Stryker’s femoral tray system is built for efficiency. One general hip instrument tray is compatible across three femoral stems (Insignia, Accolade II, and Exeter), allowing for minimal tray usage and cross-compatibility.</span></span></p>\n",
